sequenceDiagram
  participant ORD as ORDER-SERVICE
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant NOTI as NOTIFICATION-SERVICE
  participant DB as notification_db

  ORD->>MQ: Publish event
  MQ->>NOTI: Deliver message
  NOTI->>NOTI: Map event type
  NOTI->>DB: Insert notification
  NOTI->>NOTI: Console log / mock email
  Note over ORD,NOTI: Consumer failure is logged only. Order transaction already committed.
